  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Cleopatra is one of history’s most famous queens."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "And she was the last queen of ancient Egypt."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "The Romans attacked Egypt."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "They wanted to take her country."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "She would not give in to them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "She killed herself in 30 BCE."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "But we still don’t know how she died."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "Some people think she let a snake bite and poison her."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "Others think she used a pin with poison on it."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "No"
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "one knows where she is buried."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "So, we will probably never know for sure how she died."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
